<title>THAILAND: TABLE-SIAM PANICH POSTS Q2 NET LOSS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SIAM PANICH POSTS Q2 NET LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Second quarter</p>
<p>				  1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	1.35     vs  profit     0.49</p>
<p>    Net	   loss    181.78     vs  profit    65.87</p>
<p>					   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	 1.13    vs  profit     0.78</p>
<p>    Net	   loss     151.61    vs  profit   105.51</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited. The company's full name is Siam Panich Leasing Plc, a leasing and hire purchase finance company.</p>
